WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.180 --> 00:00:08.420
The United Kingdom did not vote on austerity policies, it didn’t vote on the insufficient protection

00:00:08.420 --> 00:00:14.320
of external borders. The United Kingdom is not a member of the Eurozone, so the euro policies

00:00:14.320 --> 00:00:19.970
don’t apply to the United Kingdom. The United Kingdom is not part of the Schengen area

00:00:19.970 --> 00:00:25.320
so the United Kingdom is master of its own borders.

00:00:25.320 --> 00:00:31.180
So, let’s not invent anything. Stop telling stories, Mr. Farage. You told us,

00:00:31.180 --> 00:00:37.230
a few days ago, that you made a mistake on the budgetary aspects of what was at stake

00:00:37.230 --> 00:00:47.649
in the relationship between the EU and the UK. If you had said that before the vote, I could have congratulated you.

00:00:47.649 --> 00:00:58.280
But you lied. You did not tell the truth. You fabricated the reality.

00:01:03.200 --> 00:01:10.140
I enjoyed debating with you, Mr. Farage. We have the same sense of humour.

00:01:10.140 --> 00:01:17.530
You have it. I have it. I find it regrettable that this is the last occasion

00:01:17.530 --> 00:01:19.090
we will be able to debate because you won’t be coming back.

